   10: class LegacyEventLifecycle:
   11:     """Tie a legacy gameplay controller to EventManager resource ownership.
   12: 
   13:     This bridge is intentionally transitional: it does not move gameplay logic.
   14:     It guarantees that each legacy event has one managed runtime instance and
   15:     that its resource claims are released exactly once on completion/cancellation.
   16:     """
